{"type":"message","id":"d92d300c","parentId":"cce6a40a","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:51:16.002Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nAh right, the replace might be empty if the selector doesn't have \" li \" in it? Wait no, let's just remove that replace part, or use the full selector, no, wait actually the itemSelector is already the li, so we can just use the part after the li, but alternatively, let's not use replace, just query the full selector relative to the page? No, wait no, $$eval is on the itemSelector which is li elements, so when we are inside the function, each item is a li, so we just need the selector relative to the li, which is the part after \"> li \" in the selector.\nWait let's just fix this another way: let's manually extract the relative selectors first. Let's modify the script: instead of doing replace, we can get the relative part by splitting the selector on \"> li \".\nWait alternatively, let's just rewrite the verification part to get each item manually with separate queries, so we avoid the $$eval issue. Let's edit the script again, replace that whole verification part.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_j9oz5azdrgunlgfxl9f6qmht","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"extract_xmst_selector.js","oldText":"    // 验证3条公告确保正确\n    console.log('\\n=== 验证前3条公告内容 ===');\n    const sample = await page.$$eval(itemSelector, (items, selectors) => {\n      const titleSelShort = selectors.title.replace(/.*? li /, '');\n      const linkSelShort = selectors.link.replace(/.*? li /, '');\n      const dateSelShort = selectors.date.replace(/.*? li /, '');\n      return items.slice(0,3).map(item => {\n        return {\n          title: item.querySelector(titleSelShort)?.textContent?.trim() || '',\n          link: item.querySelector(linkSelShort)?.href || '',\n          date: item.querySelector(dateSelShort)?.textContent?.trim() || ''\n        };\n      });\n    }, {title: titleSelector, link: linkSelector, date: dateSelector});\n    \n    sample.forEach((item, idx) => {\n      console.log(`\\n第${idx+1}条:`);\n      console.log(`标题: ${item.title}`);\n      console.log(`链接: ${item.link}`);\n      console.log(`日期: ${item.date}`);\n    });","newText":"    // 验证3条公告确保正确\n    console.log('\\n=== 验证前3条公告内容 ===');\n    const firstThree = items.slice(0,3);\n    for (let i=0; i<firstThree.length; i++) {\n      const item = firstThree[i];\n      const title = (await item.$eval(titleSelector.replace(`${itemSelector} `, ''), el => el.textContent.trim())) || '';\n      const link = (await item.$eval(linkSelector.replace(`${itemSelector} `, ''), el => el.href)) || '';\n      let date = '';\n      try {\n        date = (await item.$eval(dateSelector.replace(`${itemSelector} `, ''), el => el.textContent.trim())) || '';\n      } catch(e) {\n        // 如果日期选择器不对，直接查找所有span/em/i元素找日期\n        const dateEls = await item.$$('span, em, i');\n        for (const el of dateEls) {\n          const text = (await el.textContent()).trim();\n          if (text.match(/(\\d{4}[-年]\\d{1,2}[-月]\\d{1,2}日?)/)) {\n            date = text;\n            dateSelector = `${itemSelector} ${await el.evaluate(e => e.tagName.toLowerCase() + (e.className ? `.${e.className.split(' ').join('.')}` : ''))}`;\n            console.log(`修正后公告发布日期选择器: ${dateSelector}`);\n            console.log(`提取到发布日期: ${date}`);\n            break;\n          }\n        }\n      }\n      console.log(`\\n第${i+1}条:`);\n      console.log(`标题: ${title}`);\n      console.log(`链接: ${link}`);\n      console.log(`日期: ${date}`);\n    }"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773427864964}}
